   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "The passive with a participle",
     "texto": [
      "The short passive participle is used, in the gender of the subject: **Книга написана** («the book is written»), **Дом построен** («the house is built»). The agent, who does the action, goes in the instrumental: **Книга написана Толстым** («the book is written by Tolstoy»).",
      "In the past the verb **быть** is used in the past: **Книга была написана** («the book was written»)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "When it is used",
     "texto": [
      "The passive is common in written and formal texts, when the result is what matters: **Текст переведён** («the text has been translated»). In ordinary conversation the active form is preferred: **Мне дали книгу** («they gave me a book»), not «Книга была дана мне»."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
